From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:29:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] README: document the HEVC encoder and the parameters the
 device supplies

The encoder README listed three codecs, two bitrate modes and NV12 as the only
input. Describe the HEVC encoder, the parameters that exist when the encoder
device has the controls for them, and the input formats the encoder passes on.
---
 README.md | 91 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 82 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

